#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_schema.rst:4
msgid "Export schema"
msgstr "导出方案"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_schema.rst:6
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows exporting the different `folios`_ to many type of "
"formats: **PNG**, **JPEG**, **Bitmap**, **SVG** and **DWX**."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech允许将不同的 `图幅 <folios_>`_ "
"导出到许多类型的格式：**PNG**,**JPEG**,**Bitmap**,**SVG** 和 **DWX**."

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_schema.rst:9
msgid "Select **File > Export** menu item to display exporting PopUp window."
msgstr "选择 **文件 > 导出** 菜单项以显示导出弹出窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_schema.rst:14
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech file menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 文件菜单"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_schema.rst:18
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcuts to increase the working "
"efficiency.     For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcut, "
"refer to `menu bar`_ section."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。有关QEctroTech键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参考 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ "
"一节。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_schema.rst:23
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + Shift + X`` to display exporting PopUp window."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + Shift + X`` 显示导出弹出窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_schema.rst:26
msgid "Choose the `folios`_ you wish to export and specify their size."
msgstr "选择要导出和指定大小的 `图幅 <folios_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_schema.rst:31
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech export PopUp window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 导出弹出窗口"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_schema.rst:33
msgid "Choose target directory and format."
msgstr "选择目标目录和格式 。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_schema.rst:38
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech exporting formats combo box"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 导出格式组合框"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_schema.rst:40
msgid "Choose rendering options."
msgstr "选择渲染选项 。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_schema.rst:45
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech rendering options"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 渲染选项"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_schema.rst:47
msgid "Press **Export** button to create the files."
msgstr "按 **输出** 按钮创建文件 。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_schema.rst:49
msgid ""
"QElectroTech creates one file for each folio in the defined target "
"directory."
msgstr "QElectroTech 在定义的目标目录中为每个folio创建一个文件。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_schema.rst:53
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows predefining exporting settings for reducing the working "
"configuration effort each time that a `project`_ have to be exported, refer "
"to `export settings`_ section for more information."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech允许在每次需要输出一个 `项目 <project_>`_ 时，为减少工作配置努力而预先定义导出设置，参考 `导出设置 "
"<export settings_>`_ 节以获取更多信息。"
